  "instruction": "Using Visual Studio Code, create a new Python script called emission_by_continent_viz.py in the /home/user/analysis_results/ directory. The dataset “Emissions Data.csv” is already in that folder. Load it using pandas. Then: (1) compute the total yearly emissions for each continent (Year on the x-axis, total Emission per continent on the y-axis) and produce a line chart saved as emission_trend_by_continent.png; (2) identify the most recent year in the dataset, compute each continent’s share of emissions in that year, and produce a bar chart (bars sorted descending by emission share) saved as emission_share_latest_year.png. Make sure axes, legends, titles and sorting are clear and readable.",
